      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "01",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "提交记录",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "执行者提交结果记录及受控引用",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "02",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "尝试定位",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "另一位成员定位数据、脚本与条件并提出缺项",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "03",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "补充缺项",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "执行者补充说明，保留异常与排除依据",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "04",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "负责人确认",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "负责人确认后，记录进入可讨论版本",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "如果涉及新的访问授权：暂停共享，由负责人处理",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "name": "",
      "text": "复核不要求复做整项实验，也不代替科学结论审查。",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "chapter-8",
      "text": "03",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "title-8",
      "text": "试点范围",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1875,
      "fontSizePx": 25,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "page-8",
      "text": "08",
      "sizeHundredPt": 900,
      "fontSizePx": 12,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "四周试点只测试一件事",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "范围是拟定安排，不代表已经测得效率提升或完成率。",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "4",
      "sizeHundredPt": 3600,
      "fontSizePx": 48,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "周",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "1",
      "sizeHundredPt": 3600,
      "fontSizePx": 48,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "个课题方向",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "2",
      "sizeHundredPt": 3600,
      "fontSizePx": 48,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "名自愿成员",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "1",
      "sizeHundredPt": 975,
      "fontSizePx": 13,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "第 1 周",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "明确最少字段用一个结果试填",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "2",
      "sizeHundredPt": 975,
      "fontSizePx": 13,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "第 2 周",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "在实际工作中记录缺项与负担",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "3",
      "sizeHundredPt": 975,
      "fontSizePx": 13,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "第 3 周",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "继续记录观察填写负担",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "4",
      "sizeHundredPt": 975,
      "fontSizePx": 13,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "第 4 周",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "讨论保留、修改或停止",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "开始试点前",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "负责人确认范围与授权联系人",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "成员认可最少字段",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "name": "",
      "text": "明确谁负责复核",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "chapter-9",
      "text": "04",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "title-9",
      "text": "评估与收束",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1875,
      "fontSizePx": 25,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "page-9",
      "text": "09",
      "sizeHundredPt": 900,
      "fontSizePx": 12,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "是否继续，由复核证据与成员负担决定",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "试点评估先收集具体复核过程和当事人反馈，不预设统一“合格分数”。",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "01",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1875,
      "fontSizePx": 25,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "来源可定位",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "其他成员能否沿记录定位结果的来源",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "02",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1875,
      "fontSizePx": 25,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "依据可理解",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "关键处理与排除是否有可理解的依据",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "03",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1875,
      "fontSizePx": 25,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "负担可持续",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "填写负担是否在成员愿意持续承担的范围内",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1275,
      "fontSizePx": 17,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "停止或修改的信号",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1575,
      "fontSizePx": 21,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "挤占必要实验时间权限边界无法说明只增加抄写，没有帮助解释结果",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "先让一次结果可以被理解，再决定哪些记录值得长期保存。",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1875,
      "fontSizePx": 25,
      "typeface": "Noto Serif SC"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "name": "",
      "text": "归档工具只是承载方式；要验证的是结果、依据和责任边界的联系。",
      "sizeHundredPt": 1125,
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "typeface": "Noto Sans SC"
    }
  ]
}